<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-10-13T21:23:52.885Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 21:23:52 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthis launched a second missile strike on Riyadh airport, killing an airline captain and a Pakistani national and injuring many, prompting Saudi Arabia to close the airport and vow a serious response. Saudi-led coalition aircraft struck oil facilities west of Sanaa and targeted Houthi positions, while Houthis threatened Aramco facilities and airports. Iran’s foreign minister called the Saudi Crown Prince to urge diplomatic solutions as Iran-backed militants continue pressure on the Crown Prince. A migrant boat from Djibouti to Yemen capsized, killing 139 people, including children. The conflict produced 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/saudi-arabia-s-military-struggle-against-houthi-attacks/a-79650857?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168573&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/11/world/middleeast/saudi-arabia-options-houthis.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/videos/cqx298yx4k48o?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168559&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxQZW5UZm9rTkVDR01LTzZFcTQ0MUprS3hKLTdHaWtXQkVUQzdOSzNJUWJxRlQ3WkpnbUl0TzZlMWg2eVI1bzJidmpzQnFlaC1VcVRpS1FaN0tvZENEeS1LMUVPVmFaM3o0cEI2bkx6bGhMZ1c4WXliLTg3c0djRjgwUU9YWTE5d3F5dFlVV3hlWXh4clk0eUZNWGczUnhUbmtsbElkR2ExNEFqcVRKUEJwT053?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.